%N A398999 The binomial matrix of the factorial numbers. Square array read by ascending antidiagonals.
%C A398999 See the comments and links in A399000.
%H A398999 Peter Luschny, <a href="https://github.com/PeterLuschny/Gists/blob/main/GnomonicExpansionAndBinomialMatrices.ipynb">Gnomonic Expansion and Binomial Matrices</a>, a Python notebook.
%F A398999 A(n, n) = n!.
%F A398999 A(n, k) = Sum_{m=0..d} binomial(d, m) * s^(d - m) * (p + m)!, where d = abs(n - k), p = min(n, k), s = 1 if k <= n, otherwise -1.
